The "AMP" power control is likely the power switch on the amp panel at the right of the Bass 500 head, labeled "Power" (around x=991, y=420). However, the plugin's own power button at the bottom (678, 583) could also be what's meant.

"Turn off AMP" most plausibly refers to the amp's power switch on the Bass 500 panel.

